cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below. Please also cite the FlyWire, Male CNS and BANC connectome datasets it uses."
type: software
title: "Bill and Ted fly adventures: FSOT residual experiments on measured fly connectomes"
authors:
  - family-names: Palumbo
    given-names: Damian Arthur
repository-code: "https://github.com/dappalumbo91/bill-and-ted-fly-adventures"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  FSOT residual-hop experiments on measured fly wiring (FlyWire, Male CNS,
  BANC): baseline "Bill" vs numbered experiments "TED". Zero free parameters;
  measured edges are not replaced by learned weights.
keywords: [fsot, drosophila, connectomics, neuroscience]
